# TEMPORARY, FOR THE DESIGN VOTE. Delete this whole file when a theme is picked.
#
# The switcher lives at /preview, but people share bare domains. Without this,
# a board member forwarded "blackshearpta.org" lands on the homepage rendered
# in whichever theme happens to be the default and reasonably concludes the
# decision is already made.
#
# 302, not 301. A permanent redirect gets cached by browsers and intermediaries
# and would keep sending people to /preview long after the page is deleted,
# with no way to reach them and tell them otherwise.
# Trailing slash on purpose. Astro builds directory-style URLs, so /preview
# itself 307s to /preview/; targeting the bare path costs every visitor an
# extra round trip before the page starts loading.
/    /preview/    302
